WEBVTT

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.450
Chara-su!

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:05.400
Today we're kicking off Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.190
I'm Shugo Chara Egg!'s Amulet Heart, Mizuki!

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:08.190
Amulet Heart: Fukumura Mizuki

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:11.110
I'm Amulet Spade, Akari! Nice to meet you!

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.110
Amulet Spade: Saho Akari

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:14.280
I'm Amulet Clover, Irori! Let's have fun together!

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.280
Amulet Clover: Maeda Irori

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:15.860
And now let's start...

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.050
...Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:20.140
Everyone's Hearts: Unlock!

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:22.500
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.010
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:29.810
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.680
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:33.530
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:35.410
you're like a dream.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.260
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:39.150
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.990
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:40.990 --> 00:00:42.790
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:46.590
Whenever I start something new

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:50.300
I get really excited,

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.970
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:57.110
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:04.750
I've always thought it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:08.540
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:12.670
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:17.290
It's party time!

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:21.040
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.780
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:24.780 --> 00:01:28.980
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:32.190
It's party time!

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:35.900
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.410
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:44.040
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:45.830
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:51.630
Hi there, Shugo Chara Egg!

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:53.730
I'm the narrator, Kaho!

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.030
Let's be friends, 'kay?

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:56.840
Sure!

00:01:56.840 --> 00:02:01.720
So first off, let's fill our viewers in on what Shugo Chara Party's going to be like, 'kay?

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.770
Right! We'll be continuing Shugo Chara!! Doki as...

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.830
Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki!

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:07.770
That starts today!

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:10.650
And not only that, we also have an anime starring the Guardian Characters called...

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.790
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:12.790 --> 00:02:14.070
Also for your viewing pleasure!

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:17.530
But that's not all! We'll also feature fortune-telling and information about auditions!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.050
Shugoi!

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:21.240
What a jam-packed half hour!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.050
So what's up first?

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:25.330
The anime starring the Guardian Characters!

00:02:25.330 --> 00:02:27.680
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:28.980
Enjoy!

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.530
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:39.230
"Introductions!"

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.630
I'm Ran!

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:42.950
I'm Miki!

00:02:42.950 --> 00:02:44.250
And I am Su!

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.150
To those of you meeting us for the first time...

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:48.340
As well as the people who've been watching us from day one...

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.830
All together now...

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:50.870
Doki!

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:54.400
Wait! We're not doing "Doki" anymore. It's "Pucchi Puchi" now!

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:55.990
You're quite correct!

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.450
Well then, let's come up with a new pose!

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:01.350
How about...

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:06.220
Give it up for the peppy Guardian Character who cheers you toward your dreams, Ran!

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:06.800
And Miki!

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:07.800
And Su!

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:10.300
Hold up.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.550
Why are you in the center, Ran?

00:03:12.550 --> 00:03:15.100
Because the peppy character's always in the middle!

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:16.510
Says who?!

00:03:16.510 --> 00:03:17.880
Now, don't quarrel.

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.190
How about this?

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:25.300
Thank you very much for coming to see me today!

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:28.520
By the way, the girls behind me are Ran and Miki.

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:30.970
Now wait just a second!

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:33.700
We're like, totally supporting characters now!

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.600
I've always wanted to try that, just once.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:37.990
Honestly...

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:40.290
Let me handle this!

00:03:40.290 --> 00:03:43.570
I, born and raised inside an egg,

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.780
and now, occasionally residing in an egg,

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.110
go by the name of Miki and nothing more.

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:50.430
I implore you, welcome "the wandering art master."

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.290
Miki will now take the stage!

00:03:53.430 --> 00:03:55.830
When's our cue, huh?!

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:56.660
Desu!

00:03:56.660 --> 00:03:58.050
Oops, I plum forgot!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:04:00.040
You two are incredibly selfish!

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:02.140
Like you can talk, Su!

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.780
Neither can you, Ran!

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:04.940
Argh!

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:06.010
Girls, please stop.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:08.430
Goodness, what are you doing?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.070
Practicing our introductions.

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:14.300
We want to introduce ourselves to all our new friends.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:15.710
Is that so?

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:20.460
But if you make such surly faces, don't you think you'll frighten them?

00:04:20.990 --> 00:04:25.040
True... I guess I was only thinking about making myself stand out.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:26.520
Yeah, same here...

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:30.640
It's important to greet our friends with smiles.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:32.680
Let's take it from the top!

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:35.100
Hey! Why don't you join us, Dia?

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:38.660
Sure, but our new friends are already here.

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:40.470
Look, right over there.

00:04:42.870 --> 00:04:44.260
Any...

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.280
Anyway!

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:47.070
How silly of us!

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.760
Nice to meet you all!

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:50.800
That's not fair, Dia!

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:51.830
I'm here, too!

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:53.280
Nice to meet you, everyone!

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:54.840
Yeah, real nice!

00:04:57.460 --> 00:05:00.120
See you again!

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:02.670
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:05:02.670 --> 00:05:07.200
The first Character we'll introduce is... Ran!

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:34.410
Ran

00:05:08.940 --> 00:06:09.470
Song: Dream-chasing Racer

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:13.610
Ran was the first Guardian Character born from Amu-chan's Guardian Eggs.

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:19.540
She's super athletic and full of spirit!

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:40.020
Continuing on, the second Character is... Miki!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:06:05.890
Miki

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:44.400
She's the second of Amu's Guardian Characters to be born!

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:50.120
She's an incredibly gifted artist and has a rather cool personality.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:05.890
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:07.830
Look forward to it!

00:06:11.820 --> 00:06:13.380
Amulet Heart?

00:06:13.380 --> 00:06:13.980
Yep!

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:15.530
Amulet Spade?

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:16.150
Here!

00:06:16.150 --> 00:06:17.700
Amulet Clover?

00:06:17.700 --> 00:06:18.230
Present!

00:06:18.230 --> 00:06:19.620
Good answers!

00:06:19.620 --> 00:06:24.320
Hey, do you know the meaning of the word "amulet" that's in your names?

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.910
Of course we do.

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:28.070
Yes, of course.

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:31.000
An amulet is a charm that brings good luck.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.400
Right! It's the kind of charm you wear!

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.890
What kind of amulets do you all have?

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.130
Tell us!

00:06:41.680 --> 00:06:44.320
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:47.170
"Dia and the Flower."

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:04.760
This might work perfectly!

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.550
How nice!

00:07:06.550 --> 00:07:07.410
Looks good on you!

00:07:07.410 --> 00:07:09.150
It's wonderful!

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:12.610
Ready, set...

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:13.750
Fan!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:14.690
Mountain!

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:16.290
Plane!

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:20.340
Oh, Dia! Perfect timing!

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:23.570
Play with us, Dia!

00:07:23.570 --> 00:07:25.130
We're doing group gymnastics!

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:29.420
They didn't notice my flower?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:32.150
What pose should we do next?

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:34.270
How about a pyramid?

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.340
You can't do a pyramid with only four people, though.

00:07:37.340 --> 00:07:38.830
True...

00:07:38.830 --> 00:07:41.100
What could we do instead?

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:44.820
Wait, I know! Let's invite Pepe and Kusukusu to join us!

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:47.650
Oh, then we could make a great big pyramid!

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:49.180
Okay, let's do that!

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:50.540
Dia!

00:07:50.540 --> 00:07:51.570
Huh?

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:10.940
Where could Dia have gone?

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.590
It's a flower!

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.130
Wait, isn't this the flower...

00:08:18.130 --> 00:08:21.520
...Dia was just wearing?

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.980
Dia!

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.940
Here! This is yours, right?

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:33.000
You had it pinned on your shirt before, didn't you?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.170
Oh, you noticed?

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:37.120
I just had a burst of inspiration!

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.140
Adorable!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:42.150
It looks fabulous on you!

00:08:42.590 --> 00:08:43.680
Thank you!

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:46.620
Hey, let's try adding more flowers!

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.040
Ooh, I like that idea!

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.630
Let's do it!

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:54.150
Oh dear, Dia is angry!

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:55.960
Maybe we went a bit overboard...

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:56.930
Guess so...

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:59.820
Hey, wait right there!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:02.090
Why would you make me look like this?!

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:04.020
Sorry!

00:09:04.850 --> 00:09:07.980
See you again!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.220
Coming up next...

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:10.200
What you've been waiting for...

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.660
The Shugo Chara anime...

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.150
Dokki Doki!

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:16.280
Today's story is about a lively transfer student!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:18.300
A transfer student?

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:20.510
Are we getting a new character?

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:36.800
What's really important?

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:42.850
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:50.110
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:09:51.390 --> 00:10:01.450
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:06.170
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:10.540
They're all precious things.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:14.710
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.240
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:19.300
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:22.730
you're not alone.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.890
We'll always be together.

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:27.530
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:30.560
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.740
Open Heart, now!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:35.400
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:40.410
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:46.250
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.470
I'll be counting on you!

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.260
It's so peaceful.

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.280
Indeed, it is.

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:10.960
What is she doing?

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:21.430
Sorry, I can only give you a bit of water.

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:23.370
That's kind of you.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:30.580
Oh no I'm not that kind I'm-

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.970
Thanks!

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.730
Who are those little fellas?

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:47.200
You can see my Charas?

00:11:48.120 --> 00:11:51.620
Guardian Characters represent who you want to be.

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:55.480
Your heart's egg holds within it all of your potential future selves.

00:11:55.780 --> 00:11:59.280
And Guardian Characters are born from them!

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:04.220
But if you can see us, then you must be a Character Bearer, too.

00:12:04.220 --> 00:12:07.440
I don't see a heart's egg, though.

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:12.290
Well, maybe your heart's egg will be born soon.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:15.920
Ooh, it's a butterfly! Butter-butter-butterfly!

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:15.920
She ain't listenin'.

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:16.580
Say what?

00:12:16.580 --> 00:12:20.290
Come on! We're talking 'bout important stuff here!

00:12:21.650 --> 00:12:25.790
I'm Hiiragi Rikka, and I'm a second-grader in elementary school!

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:29.500
I just transferred to Seiyo Academy Elementary School today!

00:12:31.780 --> 00:12:35.980
01 - The Super-Peppy Transfer Student!

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:40.400
She can see Guardian Characters, but doesn't have one herself?

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:42.930
I'd heard we were getting a transfer student.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:44.370
I guess that's her.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:46.570
She seems nice, and really spunky.

00:12:46.570 --> 00:12:49.340
And she was watering a flower growing on the road?

00:12:49.340 --> 00:12:51.040
She definitely sounds like a nice person.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.830
I do that kind of stuff, too!

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:57.110
Didn't you just forget to water the flowerbeds?

00:12:57.110 --> 00:12:58.290
Um, well...

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.340
It's worrisome...

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:04.260
Once we graduate, you'll be the only Guardian left, Yaya.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:07.590
You'll have to take the reins and lead everyone.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:11.520
Not only that, you'll have to give presentations.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.460
I'll be fine!

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:17.930
This is quite vexing.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.620
Yes-dechu.

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:21.570
We've got trouble!

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:23.580
It's Rikka-chan!

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:31.710
Rikka-chan!

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:33.080
Climb down from there!

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.020
Come to me.

00:13:35.020 --> 00:13:37.110
Everything will be just fine.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:44.210
You climbed the tree and now you can't get down, right?

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.590
Here, kitty, kitty.

00:13:47.950 --> 00:13:49.760
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:55.030
That's right, come to Rikka.

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:00.980
Watch out!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.450
Character Change!

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.810
Wow!

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.350
Hinamori-san's always so awesome!

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.410
Sweet!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:33.890
The Guardians are so cool!

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:37.080
Whoa...

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:40.420
You really had us worried.

00:14:40.420 --> 00:14:41.880
Sorry 'bout that.

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:46.740
From now on, please either call a teacher first or let us Guardians handle it.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:49.570
Um, what's a Guardian?

00:14:49.900 --> 00:14:51.620
Oh ho! Does someone need some exposition?!

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:57.650
The Guardians are kind of like a special student council made up of students for the students.

00:14:57.650 --> 00:15:02.190
We share yummy tea and cakes in the Royal Garden every day!

00:15:02.190 --> 00:15:03.810
That's not all we do, dummy!

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:10.490
The Guardians consist of four positions: the King's Chair, the Queen's Chair,

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:15.570
the Jack's Chair, and the Ace's Chair, which are assigned on a yearly basis.

00:15:15.570 --> 00:15:20.890
We mostly handle the student's personal information, keep them safe, and-

00:15:19.590 --> 00:15:22.810
These capes are super awesome!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:23.500
She ain't listenin'!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.520
Rima-chan, calm down.

00:15:25.520 --> 00:15:29.600
These are called Royal Capes, and only the Guardians get to wear them.

00:15:29.600 --> 00:15:33.710
But Hinamori-san's position as the Joker is kind of special, so she doesn't wear one.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.700
I never wanted to wear it in the first place.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.180
What a waste!

00:15:38.180 --> 00:15:40.170
I wanna wear a Royal Cape!

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.610
Let me try one on!

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:43.210
Unfortunately, it's not that easy...

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:48.600
Since you can see Guardian Characters, one day you might get to.

00:15:48.600 --> 00:15:49.960
Promise?

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.720
Wait!

00:16:02.690 --> 00:16:04.320
I sense an X Egg!

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:06.850
Amu-chan, it's nearby.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:09.050
Everyone, split up and search for it!

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.080
Right!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:12.360
Rikka-chan, please go back to class.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.700
What's shakin'?

00:16:17.980 --> 00:16:20.060
Tadase, it's up ahead!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:21.410
It's in the art room!

00:16:31.180 --> 00:16:32.540
Oh my...

00:16:32.540 --> 00:16:33.500
Amu-chan.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:34.540
Right.

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:35.580
Miki!

00:16:35.580 --> 00:16:36.300
Got it!

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:39.040
My heart:

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:40.530
My heart:

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:41.850
Unlock!

00:16:58.570 --> 00:17:01.440
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:07.140
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:22.060
Colorful Canvas!

00:17:28.520 --> 00:17:30.150
What's going on?

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:35.860
Why are you doing this?

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:37.320
Rikka-chan?

00:17:39.400 --> 00:17:42.200
I understand. You're sad because you can't draw.

00:17:43.410 --> 00:17:44.370
What did you say?

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:48.390
Weren't you listening? That's what this little guy just said.

00:17:48.390 --> 00:17:49.730
Wait, can you...

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.430
You can understand the X Egg?

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:55.030
Even we can't do that.

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:57.930
Rikka-chan, please tell us what it's saying.

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:02.870
"Everyone's always telling me that my drawings are terrible."

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:06.080
"So I'm not going to draw ever again."

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:14.900
Aren't you the one who thinks your drawings are terrible?

00:18:16.730 --> 00:18:18.980
Why are you making excuses and blaming others?

00:18:18.980 --> 00:18:21.240
If you think you're no good, you should draw even more!

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:24.080
And then, one day, you're sure to get better!

00:18:28.560 --> 00:18:30.880
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:34.870
Open Heart!

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:53.100
Thank goodness.

00:18:53.100 --> 00:18:55.930
Someone's dream is on their way back to them.

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.660
Cool!

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:01.530
I definitely wanna be a Guardian like you someday, Hinamori-san!

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.970
Thanks...

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:09.030
Um, you called that little guy a X Egg?

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:14.270
Yeah. When you think your dreams are impossible, and want to give up,

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:16.870
an "X" gets put on your heart's egg.

00:19:16.870 --> 00:19:18.410
That's what an X Egg is.

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:22.220
If it becomes an X Character, it can cause a lot of trouble for other people.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:26.710
So if you ever find one, let us know right away, all right?

00:19:26.710 --> 00:19:27.850
They're dangerous.

00:19:32.550 --> 00:19:35.950
You don't know who the X Eggs belong to?

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:37.760
Well...

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:41.660
Not usually, no.

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:47.200
It's also possible that the owner gets a new heart's egg.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:49.600
So the other one gets abandoned?

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.420
I don't think so...

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:54.920
Well, I guess it happens to some X Eggs, once in a while.

00:19:56.010 --> 00:19:57.670
That's so sad...

00:19:59.400 --> 00:20:00.590
What's the matter?

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.640
Oh, never mind! Forget it!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:09.040
I'm home!

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:34.140
So you guys are called X Eggs, huh?

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:41.670
I wonder if I can become a Guardian even when I'm friends with you guys?

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:44.270
No way, no way, no way!

00:20:44.270 --> 00:20:45.460
Oh, hush!

00:20:45.460 --> 00:20:48.160
I'm totally gonna become a Guardian! Just you watch!

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:50.080
No way!

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:53.960
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:57.110
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:07.800
Guardian Egg Friendship Forecast!

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:10.360
First, for those people who chose Ran:

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.380
You get four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:11.380 --> 00:21:12.620
Super Lucky!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:18.390
The best possible friendship luck! You'll solve all your problems with the support of your friends!

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:20.380
Su's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:18.390 --> 00:21:22.780
Try striking up a conversation with people you've just met!

00:21:20.380 --> 00:21:22.420
You might make a new friend!

00:21:22.720 --> 00:21:24.700
Miki's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:22.780 --> 00:21:28.550
It's important to be honest!

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:27.960
You have a chance to make up with friends you've argued with!

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:31.620
Finally, for those who chose Dia's egg:

00:21:31.620 --> 00:21:35.150
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:39.270
You might accidentally forget a promise you made to a friend.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:41.070
Your lucky item is a mechanical pencil!

00:21:41.070 --> 00:21:43.910
Make sure to double-check your schedule, 'kay?

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:48.280
Hey, doesn't Shugo Chara Egg! have four members?

00:21:48.280 --> 00:21:49.860
You just noticed this now?

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:51.200
Aren't we missing someone?

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:52.570
Bit slow on the uptake, are we?

00:21:52.570 --> 00:21:55.270
Our fourth member is right over there!

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:57.000
Huh? Where?

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.190
On the other side of the screen!

00:21:58.190 --> 00:21:59.560
Eh?!

00:22:00.770 --> 00:22:04.050
Shugo Chara Egg! Amulet Diamond Auditions!

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:08.640
The auditions started on the official Nakayoshi magazine homepage in September!

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:14.270
Note: Nakayoshi magazine serializes the Shugo Chara manga in Japan.

00:22:08.640 --> 00:22:14.270
All of you who want to become a member of Shugo Chara Egg!, we're calling you! Yes, you!

00:22:15.210 --> 00:22:17.250
Here's who is eligible to try out!

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:28.820
Audition Requirements:

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:28.820
Girls from first grade elementary to third year middle school.

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:28.820
Able to commute to lessons in Tokyo.

00:22:15.360 --> 00:22:28.820
No contracts with other talent agencies or record companies.

00:22:17.250 --> 00:22:22.420
For more details, see the program's website, or the latest issue of Nakayoshi!

00:22:22.420 --> 00:22:25.180
The deadline to apply is October 19th!

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:28.820
We can't wait to see all your auditions!

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:31.730
Hooray!

00:22:31.730 --> 00:22:34.370
We hope you'll all try out! We'll be waiting for you!

00:22:34.720 --> 00:22:37.000
I just know we'll get along great!

00:22:37.000 --> 00:22:39.580
That's right! Be who you want to be!

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:42.280
See you next week for another episode of Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:42.280 --> 00:22:45.920
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:45.920 --> 00:22:47.690
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.340 --> 00:22:57.750
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.250 --> 00:23:18.410
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:22.290
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:24.840 --> 00:23:29.990
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:29.990 --> 00:23:33.800
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.400 --> 00:23:39.780
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:45.180
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:52.390
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.390 --> 00:23:56.480
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.480 --> 00:24:02.540
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:08.800
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:09.890
Bravo!

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:14.350
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
